= Anti-Fengtian War

After Feng Yuxiang's betrayal against the Zhili, the political balance in China has shifted wildly. Now, Zhang Zuolin and Wu Peifu have unexpectedly banded together to defeat Feng Yuxiang after his betrayal.

- @next: The outcome is...

@next
on-arrival: henan_governor = "Liu Zhenhua"; henan_faction = "Zhili"; hebei_faction = "Fengtian"; hebei_governor = "Zhang Zuolin"; beiyang_leader = "Zhang Zuolin"; deputy_beiyang_leader = "N/A"

After a failed campaign into Mukden, the Guominjun has been defeated by Zhang Zuolin and Wu Peifu. Zhang Zuolin has effectively taken Beijing and became the Beiyang Government's most powerful leader and dictator. Dark times are ahead for the north.

